WEBVTT

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:35.490
Suigin Meets Riku Rei!

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:40.540
Shinryou Academy

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:40.530
Hey, did you hear?

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:45.380
This school was built on 
top of an old graveyard.

00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:49.090
Shinryou Private Academy

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:47.780
I've heard that, too.

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:51.830
That's apparently why there's old 
graves around the school grounds.

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:54.680
That's creepy. Seriously, stop.

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:57.780
I really can't handle stuff like that.

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:02.310
And then, the other day, 
a second-year guy...

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:03.140
Girls' Dormitory

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:07.060
apparently saw a ghost at the 
cemetery next to this dorm!

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:08.190
Seriously?!

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:11.630
No, no, no! I can't!

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:19.940
Girls, it's almost time for lights out.

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:21.820
Riku Rei-neesama!

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:24.680
Clean up and get to bed.

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:26.340
Okay.

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:28.260
Good night, Onee-sama.

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:29.450
Good night.

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:32.170
Yes, goodnight.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:44.300
"Lights out at 10 PM.

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:48.080
No changes again to all the 
dorm residents today."

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:54.950
Just another quiet night.

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:58.200
Another day in the life with no changes...

00:02:59.350 --> 00:03:00.320
<i>But...</i>

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:03.350
<i>no one knows...</i>

00:03:05.270 --> 00:03:11.150
<i>that there's someone fighting to 
protect these peaceful days.</i>

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:15.040
Hey!

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:25.530
<i>A world so far away that your 
voice wouldn't reach...</i>

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:30.060
<i>All alone, in a world that's 
completely closed off...</i>

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:33.200
<i>Even now...</i>

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:07.050
<i>He's beginning his battle all alone.</i>

00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:24.080
The mausoleum where the treasure lies...

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:27.590
Zero... Stage zero.

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:29.780
Open up the grave...

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:32.510
Steal the treasure!

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:38.420
Wanchoi! Come here!

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:46.360
There, there. Hey, come on.

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:56.600
Day after day... These guys 
honestly don't give up.

00:04:57.820 --> 00:04:59.490
Suigin.

00:04:59.490 --> 00:05:01.940
Riku Suigin!

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:06.440
Kill... Kill him!

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:21.860
Whoa.

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:24.420
Well, then...

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:27.010
I guess I'll get started, too.

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:03.690
I wonder how many nights have passed...

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:15.600
Since I began this battle for this 
mausoleum against countless undead.

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:37.430
One day, when this battle ends...

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:40.360
Someday...

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:45.910
I'll...

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:51.560
One Year Ago, Summer

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:03.890
Hey, are you listening?

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:06.830
You've got some nerve, 
taking a computer into here.

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:08.190
Huh, what?!

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:12.670
We were asking you if you've 
seen a pink-haired girl.

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:14.450
I-I haven't seen anything...

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:16.920
This is the poor student that 
keeps working part-time jobs

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:18.750
Shinryou Academy Outdoor Pool

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:19.040
that everyone keeps talking about, right?

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:21.660
If you're a lifeguard, 
you need to be more observant.

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:25.020
Er, well, I can't swim, so...

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:29.720
I just clean the pool.

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:31.640
Oh, I see.

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:35.050
Then I guess I'll just help you...

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:36.380
S-Stop!

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:39.440
...clean the pool, too!

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:44.180
Wanchoi!

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:56.770
I can't even swim...

00:07:57.430 --> 00:08:00.910
What am I doing?

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:13.090
Wanchoi?

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:16.840
Whoa, wait, hey!

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:18.910
That's enough! Stop!

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:22.600
It appears that you're awake, Suigin.

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:28.270
Ranshou?

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:37.380
You saved me?

00:08:37.380 --> 00:08:43.330
Sadly, by the time I had arrived, 
you'd already been pulled out...

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:45.860
By Riku Rei.

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:48.720
Riku... Rei?

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:54.550
She's the sole daughter of Riku Yuuki, 
vice president of God Grave Tech Company.

00:08:54.830 --> 00:08:56.000
I love you! Please!

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:58.770
She's got suitors lined up and, 
apparently, for her birthday,

00:08:58.770 --> 00:09:02.110
she had four 40-foot containers 
filled with presents.

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:06.730
She's the smartest girl at 
school, that Riku Rei-chan.

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:10.350
Wait, you really don't know her? Seriously?

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:16.360
<i>Then that's...</i>

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:28.340
Wh-Wh-What should I do?!

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:14.290
Thousand Graves!

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:51.840
It's okay, I won't lose.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:58.930
Yes...

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.140
I won't lose.

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:05.130
I continue fighting to 
protect this world...

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:08.860
And most importantly, to protect you.

00:11:12.470 --> 00:11:14.860
<i>One day, I'll...</i>

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:29.170
<i>see you again...</i>

00:13:00.470 --> 00:13:05.470
Next Time
Suigin Gets Closer to Riku Rei!

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:04.270
The Silver Guardian!
